OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with some patchy light
OL,6,Frain and drizzle through the morning
OL,7,Fand afternoon. Rain is then likely to
OL,8,Fturn heavy for a time late afternoon.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FA band of heavy rain spreads
OL,11,Feast this evening, quickly clearing to
OL,12,Fleave the rest of the night mainly dry
OL,13,Fwith just the chance of a few light
OL,14,Fshowers.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FA bright but rather breezy
OL,17,Fday with a few sunny spells between
OL,18,Fscattered showers. Feeling rather
OL,19,Fchilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
