OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHeavy
OL,6,Fshowers on Wednesday with a risk of
OL,7,Fthunder. Scattered showers thereafter,
OL,8,Fbecoming isolated by Friday. Remaining
OL,9,Fcool throughout.
